source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT * FROM (SELECT 1 AS p, 's' AS q UNION ALL SELECT 2 AS k, 's' AS z) x WHERE q = 's'"
---
Union
:- Project [1 AS p#0, 's' AS q#1]
:  +- OneRowRelation (shared #1)
+- Project [2 AS k#2, 's' AS z#3]
   +- Shared #1, printed above
